{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13615","headline":"秦人谣 · 古之奇","name":"秦人谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微生祖龙代，却思尧舜道。\n何人仕帝庭，拔杀指佞草。\n奸臣弄民柄，天子恣衷抱。\n上下一相蒙，马鹿遂颠倒。\n中国既板荡，骨肉安可保。\n人生贵年寿，吾恨死不早。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"古之奇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}